Package: odpm
Version: 4.0-1
Architecture: all
Maintainer: odpm maintainers <odpm-maintainers@noreply.github.com>
Installed-Size: 590
Depends: python3:any (>= 3.10~), python3-packaging, git
Recommends: docker.io | moby-engine | docker-ce
Section: python
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/aayartsev/odoo_dev_project
Description: Odoo Developers Project Manager
 Declarative environment manager for Odoo development projects.
 Reads odpm.json from a project repository and prepares Docker-based
 development stacks (clone sources, build images, compose up PostgreSQL
 and Odoo). Zero runtime Python dependencies beyond the system interpreter.
